{
  "id": "ai4sgExtract0001",
  "name": "AI4SG · C Extract & Interpretation",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## C · Extract & Interpretation (runs the Extraction Skill)\nCalled once per new source. Loads the expert **Extraction Skill** and the experts' **worked examples** → fetches the full text (PDF or web page) → the model extracts and interprets each field following the experts' framework (cost, benefit, beneficiaries, strength of evidence …), learning their conventions from the examples.\nEvery field must cite the source (original-language sentence + English translation); **Verify Evidence** checks each quote really occurs in the text and lowers confidence if not. Everything is saved as *pending review* for the audit page.",
        "width": 2140,
        "height": 170
      },
      "id": "4f1b95ec-5e2c-59ae-94ab-f52b5b9cac33",
      "name": "Note · title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -470
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧑‍🔬 Extraction Skill in\n`skills/extraction/SKILL.md`: field definitions and interpretation rules (the experts' focus and priors, e.g. cost and benefit).\n\n`skills/extraction/examples/*.md`: extractions the experts made by hand, used as worked examples in the prompt.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "98d29447-9ee9-5ea9-aadc-e691e4ffaefb",
      "name": "Skill in",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Fetch full text\nDownload the source; PDFs (government and conference reports) go through PDF text extraction, web pages through HTML extraction. The text is kept so quotes can be verified.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "9aa8754a-0b02-53a9-b2c8-cd75ad38228f",
      "name": "Fetch",
